omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V494xfEKNr0Q7kNvwFwXqB8&_nc_oc=AdrAy9par6fnGP53n-QRCLQmIe16WNJdQN-r17jIh5L_Zd4RnNnOr-MdD019VNQWlqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4S6vyJTQ9PdZfYhfhimUKxanimFZzV6SIJCMM7DzmeNA&oe=6A049734"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=geh7YMaSdYAQ7kNvwGt-ijA&_nc_oc=AdrLSQ5uUVpk5WsxGaS7SfmeBZFW65GJ8bO2ZZZBQ09z-EKfh623KuAMZnaIq97Vcno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4X8b-iCMZfB_z1qtrxIx07OwnwUvThw7FjGEb8O_8idA&oe=6A049896"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FxOosb6EfIoQ7kNvwEB_PXN&_nc_oc=AdqqU8QAge8L9ESXB2AQsg6C6yfqH-naR5w89nJuoiB8RMTTIeAQRmMvXl3MrAu9_2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af76eCUZ2w_0rxZuRusQ1SNFuMdpb9qXAlRqZ2t5-7E58g&oe=6A047577"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://